From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ethan Hill <ethan.hill1999@outlook.com>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 16:07:58 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 04/20] KITKAT-P2: KitKat status bar and navigation icons

- Status bar clock defaults to the right side (ClockController)
- Navbar glyphs rewritten as white outlined triangle/circle/square
- Wifi icons (the active framework ic_wifi_signal_0..4 set plus the
  flag-gated SettingsLib set and error variants) rewritten as 4.4
  arc-fan glyphs with level-based dimming
- Mobile signal needs no change: the active framework ic_signal_cellular
  family is already the classic triangle + partial fill design

Change-Id: I429027fad4b9518fc9d953072df603e686e338d8
